Content Staging: When importing objects with values in object properties, which are not assigned
to the node of the object in the target system, the values were silently dropped although the
import was reported as successful.
This has been fixed: the import now fails with an error of kind "NOT_ALLOWED" for each affected
object in an existing node, naming the object property and the node. Assign the object property
to the node and repeat the import to import the values. When the node is created by the import,
the object property is assigned to the new node automatically and the values are imported.
